  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "embla-carousel-react 是 embla-carousel 的 React 封装，仅提供一个 useEmblaCarousel hook。它通过 React 生命周期将 DOM 节点与 embla-carousel 核心实例绑定，并响应式地处理选项与插件更新；本身不包含轮播算法，只负责框架集成。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "React 生命周期绑定",
        "description": "在 React 组件挂载时创建 embla-carousel 实例，卸载时销毁实例，并同步全局选项 globalOptions。",
        "evidence": [
          "repos/ruangong-0707/embla-carousel-react/packages/embla-carousel-react/src/components/useEmblaCarousel.ts"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "选项与插件响应式更新",
        "description": "监听 options 与 plugins 变化，通过 embla-carousel-reactive-utils 比较是否相等，必要时调用核心库的 reInit 重新初始化。",
        "evidence": [
          "repos/ruangong-0707/embla-carousel-react/packages/embla-carousel-react/src/components/useEmblaCarousel.ts"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "DOM 根节点引用转发",
